🖍️ BLOCK 5 — REMAINING GATE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Install the exact run-145 RangeWater-Field-APK on both required Samsung devices.
- Repeat every precision-loupe workflow in Test 2 of the physical acceptance card.
- Confirm the crosshair shows the exact point accepted on release, including snapped
